{"id":"n2-154","title":"～ものではない (〜mono dewa nai)","jlptLevel":2,"shortExplanation":"Expresses a strong negative suggestion or prohibition: 'should not', 'must not'.","longExplanation":"「～ものではない」 is used to indicate that something should not or must not be done. It often appears in written or formal contexts, meaning 'it is not proper to...' or 'you shouldn’t...'.","formation":"Verb-dictionary form + ものではない","examples":[{"jp":"そんなことを言うものではありません。","romaji":"Sonna koto o iu mono dewa arimasen.","en":"You should not say such a thing.","words":[{"surface":"そんな","vocabId":null},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":"1313580","reading":"こと"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"言う","vocabId":"1587040","reading":"いう"},{"surface":"もの","vocabId":"1322990","reading":"もの"},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"あり","vocabId":"1225940","reading":"あり","baseForm":"ある"},{"surface":"ませ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"ん","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[]},{"jp":"公共の場で大声を出すものではない。","romaji":"Koukyou no ba de oogoe o dasu mono dewa nai.","en":"You should not raise your voice in public places.","words":[{"surface":"公共","vocabId":"1273510","reading":"こうきょう"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"場","vocabId":"1355790","reading":"ば"},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"大声","vocabId":"1414300","reading":"おおごえ"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"出す","vocabId":"1338180","reading":"だす"},{"surface":"もの","vocabId":"1322990","reading":"もの"},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[7,8,9,10]},{"jp":"彼の秘密を他の人に教えるものではありません。","romaji":"Kare no himitsu o hoka no hito ni oshieru mono dewa arimasen.","en":"You must not tell his secret to other people.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"秘密","vocabId":"